  "id": "chipotle-gazpacho",
  "name": "Chipotle Gazpacho",
  "subtitle": "A cool, smoky tomato soup with fresh toppings",
  "description": "Blend ripe vegetables, lime, almonds, and chipotle into a smooth chilled soup, then finish with avocado, herbs, and chile.",
